@item equality (value)           @tab @code{equal}    @tab relational function
@item negation of equal          @tab @code{notequal} @tab relational function
@item greater than or equal to   @tab @code{>=}       @tab relational infix
@item greater than               @tab @code{>}        @tab relational infix
